  "url": "/js/js_jquery_selectors.asp",
  "title": "jQuery DOM Selectors",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "jQuery DOM Selectors"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "jQuery vs JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "jQuery was created in 2006 by John Resig.\nIt was designed to handle Browser Incompatibilities and to simplify HTML DOM Manipulation, Event Handling, Animations, and Ajax."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "However, after JavaScript Version 5 (2009), most of the jQuery utilities can be solved with a few lines of standard JavaScript:"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Finding HTML Element by Id"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Return the element with id=\"id01\":"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElement = $(\"#id01\");",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_getelementbyid"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElement = document.getElementById(\"id01\");",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_dom_getelementbyid"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Finding HTML Elements by Tag Name"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Return all <p> elements:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElements = $(\"p\");",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_getelementsbytagname"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElements = document.getElementsByTagName(\"p\");",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_dom_getelementsbytagname"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Finding HTML Elements by Class Name"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Return all elements with class=\"intro\"."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElements = $(\".intro\");",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_getelementsbyclassname"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElements = document.getElementsByClassName(\"intro\");",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_dom_getelementsbyclassname"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Finding HTML Elements by CSS Selectors"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Return a list of all <p> elements with class=\"intro\"."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElements = $(\"p.intro\");",
      "caption": "jQuery"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_queryselectorall"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "myElements = document.querySelectorAll(\"p.intro\");",
      "caption": "JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "type": "tryit",
      "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=tryjs_jquery_dom_queryselectorall"
    }
  ]
}
